# Build context only needs docker/ (Dockerfile + entrypoint.sh) and
# mesh/bin (the dispatcher baked into the orchestrator image — Phase 10).
# Everything else just slows context upload and can invalidate caches.
# mesh/secrets stays excluded by the blanket mesh/* rule AND by its own
# gitignore: key material must never enter a build context.
.git
.github
.claude
assets
configs
logs
playbooks
ssh
mesh/*
!mesh/bin
*.md
LICENSE
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
**/.venv
**/__pycache__/
